    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "For the special case of a pure-line cross ( $ \\iota^ = \\sigma D^2, \\sigma DI^2 = \\sigma {ADI} = 0 $), Equation 23.32 simplifies considerably, to",
      "source_page": 832,
      "source_pages": [
        832
      ],
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Evolution_chapter23:p026:b6",
        "Evolution_chapter23:p026:b11"
      ],
      "source_bboxes": [
        [
          287.0,
